<title>USA: Rocklin CFD No. 4, Calif. won by Stone &amp; Youngberg.</title>
<headline>Rocklin CFD No. 4, Calif. won by Stone &amp; Youngberg.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg said it won $3.605 million of Rocklin CFD No. 4, Calif., 1997 refunding special tax bonds.</p>
